  "style": "teach_then_qa",
  "segments": [
    {
      "idx": 0,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "hook",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "这不是背答案，是扫缺口",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[hook]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "注意哈，这张卡不训练你背一整段标准答案，而是训练你看一份学生答案到底差哪句。题干问结构实体检验，学生写了钢筋保护层，又算了平均强度，还下了不合格结论。看起来会一点，但白板一扫描就会发现：内容清单不全，组织主体错位，计算判据也跑偏。",
      "startSec": 0,
      "durSec": 22.248,
      "requestId": "b2ce20ed-2e83-9df6-8713-11d7807e6818",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "answer_sheet",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "先把每一行标成 hit、partial、miss",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[answer_sheet]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第一笔，扫答案。钢筋保护层这个词不是完全错，它是部分命中；问题是它只写了一个项目。由施工单位组织这一句，主体错了。平均值比三十五小，所以不合格，这一句更危险，因为它直接拿平均强度去比设计值，跳过了实体强度的双阈值。",
      "startSec": 22.648,
      "durSec": 21.48,
      "requestId": "d4f742be-c7ae-9893-9daa-7ce1bb61d2f2",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "score_atoms",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "实体检验项目要补成完整清单",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[score_atoms]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "结构实体检验不是只写混凝土强度。学生写保护层，只补到了一格。答题纸上还要看见结构位置与尺寸偏差，再看见合同约定项目。这里的动作不是把“项目很多”写得更响，而是把漏掉的工程对象逐项放回采分槽。",
      "startSec": 44.528,
      "durSec": 18.24,
      "requestId": "391e2ed5-a652-9c23-8b1a-e1cd30218907",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "organization_gap",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "施工单位实施，不等于施工单位组织",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[organization_gap]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第二格看主体。施工单位当然参与，但它在这条链里是实施主体，不是组织主体。要写成监理单位组织，施工单位实施，监理见证全过程。你看白板上，施工单位组织这条箭头退出，监理组织这条箭头才是阅卷要扫到的主体动作。",
      "startSec": 63.168,
      "durSec": 20.424,
      "requestId": "d5579f6f-b507-942b-a5bc-9c1bfc85d5af",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "calculation_gap",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "实体强度判定跑双阈值",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[calculation_gap]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "第三格是判定依据。C35 这里不能直接拿平均值和三十五比。实体强度要看两条线：平均值不小于设计值的百分之八十八，最小值不小于设计值的百分之八十。本题三个芯样算平均值是三十点八，三十五乘百分之八十八也是三十点八；最小值二十八点五，也高于三十五乘百分之八十的二十八。临界怎么给官方分，要看评分细则或教研裁定，但你的答题纸必须把这条双阈值链写出来。",
      "startSec": 83.992,
      "durSec": 33.792,
      "requestId": "bbfba96e-c39a-9f25-8a08-7b021b603861",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "rewrite",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "把原答案重排成三格采分句",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[rewrite]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "现在才进入改写。第一段，结构实体检验除混凝土强度外，还包括钢筋保护层厚度、结构位置与尺寸偏差、合同约定项目。第二段，由监理单位组织，施工单位实施，监理见证全过程。第三段，强度按平均值不小于设计值百分之八十八、最小值不小于设计值百分之八十回判。这样写，不是更啰嗦，而是每一格都能被扫描到。",
      "startSec": 118.184,
      "durSec": 29.232,
      "requestId": "0e090d32-5af1-9229-b4ff-9f613dc91962",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "kind": "teach",
      "state": "score",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": "以后先扫答案，再补三格",
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "teaching_spine[score]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "最后扫一遍成品答案。内容清单命中，主体链命中，判定依据命中。你真正要带走的不是一段死记答案，而是一个作答动作：看到结构实体检验案例，先扫自己的答题纸，问三格齐不齐。内容清单有没有完整，组织主体有没有写对，计算判据有没有亮出来。",
      "startSec": 147.816,
      "durSec": 21.336,
      "requestId": "a96cceaf-fca7-9bd2-a8b8-8dba2df5d748",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "老师，我写了钢筋保护层，这块能拿分不？",
      "startSec": 169.552,
      "durSec": 4.224,
      "requestId": "31bbe21b-c119-930e-896f-abcc9f23e772",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 0,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[content_collapse]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "能拿一点方向分，但不稳。因为这只命中保护层，漏了结构位置与尺寸偏差和合同约定项目。主观题不是看你有没有碰到熟词，而是看清单有没有补完整。",
      "startSec": 174.176,
      "durSec": 13.224,
      "requestId": "ac82adb2-c8f1-96eb-9c46-0085e5cf49a3",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "那我直接写施工单位组织，咋就不行呢？",
      "startSec": 187.8,
      "durSec": 4.224,
      "requestId": "170d78a4-114b-9f15-9639-b996f8920800",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 1,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[wrong_organizer]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "因为你把实施主体写成组织主体了。施工单位实施检验，但组织要写监理单位，过程还要有监理见证。主体错位，阅卷会直接扣。",
      "startSec": 192.424,
      "durSec": 10.968,
      "requestId": "ce61f0f3-809b-97b3-931d-c62cd7cc98af",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "kind": "q",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "S",
      "voice": "longlaotie_v3",
      "anchor": null,
      "claim": false,
      "text": "整明白了，但平均值这块我能不能直接跟 C35 比？",
      "startSec": 203.792,
      "durSec": 5.976,
      "requestId": "5219190b-078a-9cb2-91a1-000affd112d1",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "qa_closure",
      "qaIndex": 2,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "common_errors[direct_design_compare]",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "不能。实体强度不是直接比设计值，而是平均值看百分之八十八，最小值看百分之八十。你可以不替官方抢判临界分，但公式、代入、回判这条链必须写。",
      "startSec": 210.168,
      "durSec": 13.56,
      "requestId": "8fbf15f8-9003-9952-b3dc-4e11641e6da0",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "kind": "a",
      "state": "closing_challenge",
      "qaIndex": null,
      "keycard": null,
      "speaker": "T",
      "voice": "longanhuan_v3",
      "anchor": "memory_hook",
      "claim": true,
      "text": "记住哈，A01 作答层就一句话：扫答案，补三格。内容清单、组织主体、判定依据，少一格都不是完整采分句。现在进闯关，按答题纸扫描来练。",
      "startSec": 224.128,
      "durSec": 13.008,
      "requestId": "6072bbec-0638-9a83-bff9-3ca6b8857090",
      "provider": "aliyun_cosyvoice",
      "model": "cosyvoice-v3-flash"
    }
  ]
}